# publish.list — books from Markdown: EPUB and PDF (the feature publish,
# vikix publish). epubcheck isn't in Void: vikix publish setup fetches the
# release, and it runs on the java feature's OpenJDK.
pandoc               # Markdown into EPUB, and into Typst for the PDF
typst                # the PDF
python3-BeautifulSoup4  # the e-ink table fix reads the EPUB's pages
python3-lxml         # its XML parser
python3-yaml         # publish.yml
hunspell             # the spelling (the dictionaries: vikix publish setup)
zip                  # opening and closing an EPUB by hand
unzip                # and unpacking epubcheck's release
font-ibm-plex-ttf    # the print face: IBM Plex Serif
amiri-font           # Arabic
noto-fonts-ttf       # everything else a book might quote
calibre              # ebook-viewer to read one, ebook-convert for other formats
sigil                # an EPUB opened and fixed by hand
zathura              # the PDF, beside its source
zathura-pdf-mupdf
